# Database Kuralları

Önce oku: `docs/00_PROJECT/TECH_STACK_DECISIONS.md`, `docs/07_DATABASE/`, `docs/06_BACKEND/`

## Onaylı stack

- **Primary:** PostgreSQL 17+
- **ORM:** Prisma (`packages/database`)
- **Cache:** Redis (sessions, feed, rate limiting, presence)
- **Scaling:** read replicas, partitioning, connection pooling (future)

## Schema kuralları (`DATABASE_SPECIFICATION.md`)

- Tables/columns: `snake_case`; Prisma models: `PascalCase`
- UUID primary keys; `created_at`, `updated_at`; soft delete (`deleted_at`) tercih
- Normalize by default; explicit relations; no implicit many-to-many
- Every FK indexed; Decimal for ratings; JSON only when necessary
- Query targets: read <50ms, write <100ms, feed <150ms, search <200ms

## Davranış

- Prisma: models `PascalCase`, fields `camelCase`; DB mapping via `@@map` / `@map` (`PRISMA_SCHEMA.md`)
- Explicit relations only; join tables as own models; enums for repeated values
- `findMany` always with `take` or cursor; prefer `select` over full model; cursor pagination
- Transactions for reviews, game logs, friend requests, notifications
